OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment raises concerns about  
OL,4,Abehaviour at council                   
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised by the       
OL,7,Fgovernment over the behaviour of       
OL,8,Felected councillors at a local         
OL,9,Fauthority in Bedfordshire.             
OL,11,FA warning letter has been sent to      
OL,12,FCentral Bedfordshire Council by the    
OL,13,FMinistry of Housing, Communities and   
OL,14,FLocal Government (MHCLG).              
OL,16,FIt highlights the culture of the       
OL,17,Forganisation, specifically             
OL,18,Fmember-to-member and member-to-officer 
OL,19,Fbehaviour.                             
