OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment raises concerns about  
OL,4,Abehaviour at council                   
OL,6,FA council spokesman said the letter    
OL,7,Fasked the authority "to develop a clear
OL,8,Faction plan to strengthen"             
OL,9,Frelationships and carry out "a planned 
OL,10,Freview of overview and scrutiny        
OL,11,Farrangements".                         
